# E1: the AUDITED exactness arm of lever V6. c2-packed-tp4-gate-ring is c2-packed-tp4-gate (every verify audit ON) plus the ring deltas (engine
# fabric FABRIC_1D_RING, QWEN_FAST_CCL_TOPOLOGY=ring) and nothing else: the S3a matrix gate (four users at 4,096 / 16,384 / 32,768 / 60,000
# prompt tokens, 512 out) runs every user's text against that user's text alone on the per-request engines, with the T1 and T2 audits
# comparing the packed trace's sampler and verify rows in place. The ring changes how the feature projection's reduce-scatter adds its
# partials (and the fabric's routing), so the packed block's four-way reduction order is the thing to prove: the model's tile-split all-reduce
# keeps the block's order equal to the sequential engine's, and this is where that is shown under the ring fabric.
# Duration (estimate): 60-120 min (the matrix; up to 170 with a re-run on a divergence).
# Read: POLICY PASS and every user identical to solo; no audit mismatch line; the engine log shows the ring fabric (fabric_config FABRIC_1D_RING)
# and QWEN_FAST_CCL_TOPOLOGY=ring in the launched argv. A FAIL here means the ring arm is not exact: skip TR1-TR4 and keep the control's fabric.
# OPTIONAL: a failure does not stop the window (it decides whether the ring pair runs).
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/next-3-cheap window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/next-3-cheap and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed
# from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image a build-only job builds from this same commit while production serves (it
# carries draft_wide_tp, which is new); a later commit needs a new tag. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-3m is a PLACEHOLDER: the driver of the window
# may substitute it (in every template) once the image is built from the pushed branch.
# PRODUCTION IS LIVE ON THE CARDS when the window opens: A0 is the first job and the only one that takes it down.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-3m
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-gate-ring
C2_GATE_PLAN=matrix
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=4096,16384,32768,60000
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=512
C2_GATE_JIT=record
